{"mod_id": "tfm2_mod_order", "name": "Mod List Reorder", "author": "tfm2mods", "version": "0.2.2", "description": "Reorder the mod list in the game's Mod Manager with the keyboard. The game always lists mods alphabetically by mod ID; this mod lets you put them in any order and remembers it.\n\n* Click a row or press Up / Down to select a mod (the selected row is highlighted).\n* Ctrl + Up / Down moves the selected mod. The new order is saved immediately.\n* Hold the key to keep moving.\n* If the selected mod is outside the visible part of the list, scroll with the mouse wheel.\n* Display only: load order, gameplay and saves are not affected.\n\nThe order is saved to mod_order.txt in the mod folder (one mod ID per line, # = comment). Turn the mod off and the game's default order comes back.\n\nUses only the official stable mod API (game 0.6.0 or later). Code mod (native DLL, Windows only).", "dependencies": [{"mod_id": "base", "version": ">=0.6.0"}], "last_updated": "2026-10-21"}